  "releaseNotes": "- Initial release of GUN OASIS provider.\n- Requires GUN relay server (npm install gun && node -e \"require('gun')({web:require('http').createServer().listen(8765)})\").\n- Uses GUN HTTP REST API — no Node.js SDK dependency from .NET.\n- Stores OASIS holons and avatars as GUN graph nodes with soul-based addressing.",
